{"server":"tw","storyId":"act14mini_level_act14mini_st02","groupId":"act14mini","stageId":null,"title":"中庭旅谷","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act14mini/level_act14mini_st02.txt","sourceHash":"06bdbb9f8850fa00a41f591a20ef33880b9b68f4692b0a31e1df1f00c7c43f14","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_mini02_wanedtemple"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"方小石！你在房梁上幹什麼？趕緊下來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在別的地方撒野也就算了，這可是“移山廟”啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我就不！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"村子這麼大，非要把這破廟遷到我們家的“三畝三”，這不是欺負人是什麼？周六，怎麼不遷到你家地上去呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你個小孩子懂什麼，移山廟守的是謀善村上千年的氣脈，遷廟的選址都是有講究的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"全村商量好的事，由不得你胡來！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“三畝三”之前就是塊寸草不生的荒鹼地，那時候怎麼不說它風水好？這麼多年，我爹一擔水一擔肥把地種好了，風水也跟著變了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"說白了，不就是看我們家是村裡唯一的外姓人好欺負嗎？告訴你們，想都別想！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我爹是我爹，但小爺可不是好說話的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們想靠這破廟保佑豐收？小爺今天偏偏要把這破廟炸了，騰出地方大家好種田！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你別——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_mini01_villagevacancy"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛回到家就被很多人找上門的，我只見過欠了一屁股債的賭棍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過路上你倒是講了一句實話，村裡人確實不歡迎你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都說了別讓我回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你還是沒講，到底為什麼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小小的院子站滿了人，村民們也不搭話，只是將仇白和方小石圍著，好像兩人是哪裡冒出來的新奇野獸，萬萬不能讓其逃走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳、咳......讓讓......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大家堵在這做啥，小石滿月的酒席上都沒這麼熱鬧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"攢動的人群中擠出一個男人，瘦高的個子，腳步蹣跚，喘著粗氣。他背著一截木頭，脊背彎得就和腰上的弓一樣。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男人看到方小石，先是愣了一愣，很快又把目光撇開，緩緩轉過身去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"獵戶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"緊張的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"你別忘了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過的話我肯定記得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但小石三年沒回家了，大家難道不打算讓他先喝口水，吃頓飯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都先回地裡去吧，我們爺倆一定會給村裡一個交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地裡的活本來就耽擱了，再過幾天，春分都過去了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一路上話那麼多，見了自己爹，反倒成了啞巴？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹......原來你在啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"獵戶抿了抿發白的嘴唇，沒有答兒子的話，轉身走進了屋子，把背著的木頭放在牆邊。\n少年僵在原地沒有動彈，仇白用劍柄推了他一把。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘你坐，你坐。辛苦你送這小子回來，我給你倒杯水去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用麻煩。你們父子重逢，我就不打擾了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去村子裡轉轉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我帶你去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好待著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_mini01_villagevacancy"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘，姑娘留步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"和藹的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽周六他們說，有個英姿颯爽的女英雄把方小石送回來了，所以我趕過來看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"和藹的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看姑娘這副打扮，想必......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫仇白，一個江湖人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"和藹的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謀善村住的主要是周姓人，老漢周順，是村長，也是族長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們村子藏在這炎國西北的山溝裡，可是不容易見到生人喲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"族長放心。我只是個跑江湖的，不是壞人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘誤會了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我偶然遇見了那個孩子，看他孤身一個人，所以繞了點路，送他回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘可真是俠義心腸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘遠來是客，可我們這窮地方，也實在沒什麼能拿出來招待的......姑娘要是不嫌棄——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"離兩人幾米遠的地方，是一口水井。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"有什麼東西撞進了井口上方的木桶裡，搖架空轉，木桶加速墜入井內。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一把長劍穩穩地別住了搖架，繩子收緊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"仇白將木桶搖了上來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是一隻受驚的小馱獸......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這好像是周大至家的馱獸崽子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他家母馱獸難產死了，就留下這麼個崽子。沒母馱獸帶，只能從小馴性子，估計是受了刺激跑出來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒也沒受傷，就是嗆了幾口水，暈了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個，剛才姑娘是怎麼瞬間到水井邊上的？老漢只是感覺眼睛花了一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是，武功？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"井裡全是泥水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......上周連著下了幾場大暴雨，水裡的泥巴和渣滓還沒來得及沉澱下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，前兩年大旱，地裡的莊稼大半都渴死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難怪我看村子裡打了那麼多口井......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老天爺也是不講理得很，要嘛捨不得落一滴雨，要嘛就玩命地落到成災才停。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仇姑娘，你打哪兒來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玉門那邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘說話，倒有些姜齊的口音......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我出生在那。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難怪......玉門方向，那就是從北邊進的村。要是往南邊再走走，姑娘就能看到有一段馳道都被土石流沖毀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"世道艱難。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"兩聲沙啞的哼叫，幼小的馱獸突然醒轉。女劍客鬆開手，馱獸眨眼間消失在轉角，眼前只剩下路口的一株枯槐。\n已經三月末，春天卻似乎還未趕到這個西北的小山村。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"世道艱難。聽姑娘說，遇到小石的時候他孤身一人，這孩子在外邊，想必也吃了不少苦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘，我想問問，小石這孩子......在外面到底闖了什麼禍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......談不上闖禍，只是一個人在荒野上迷了路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這孩子，打小就格外鬧騰些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"族長，關於方小石，我有些疑問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"村裡人，似乎對這孩子有敵意？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沉默了許久，男人轉身走進裡屋，不一會，抱著一摞獸皮獸骨走了出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹，你幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"家裡就還剩這點野貨，剛開春，荒野上的動物不多，但多少也能值一些錢。你都賠給人家吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還不夠？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多的也沒有了，要不爹去求求她......雖然她看著不是很好說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不是來討債的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要不是偷了財物，或者弄壞了東西，人家犯得著跑這麼遠的路押著你回來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看著就像只會幹壞事的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你幹的壞事還少嗎......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_mini02_wanedtemple"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"震驚的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"天！這門，這梁......塌了一半......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"震驚的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"幾百年了，移山廟好好地立在這，保佑著我們，如今就這麼毀了......大不敬啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，還好先祖像沒啥大事，先別磕頭了，把罪魁禍首抓回來再說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"震驚的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"哦對了，方小石呢？怎麼沒影了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"那小子自己好像也被炸傷了，我看他流著血，一瘸一拐跑出了村子。那麼多炸藥，活該......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"震驚的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"震驚的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"本來只是一塊地的事情，有商有量，什麼問題不能解決呢。這下子可倒好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"行了行了，你去通知族長。我去獵戶家......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"震驚的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是說他往村子外面跑了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"憤怒的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"那小子身上帶著那麼重的傷，不得通知人去找呀！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_mini01_villagevacancy"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他用自己鼓搗的炸藥炸了村裡的廟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三年前，他才十一二歲吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他爹以前是個獵戶，有時候也做些土炸藥堵野獸的窩，那孩子打小就機靈，膽子也大，竟然偷摸把這門手藝學會了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個我領教過......還真像他會做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是村口那間廟吧，我來的時候看過一眼，很特別。裡面供奉的是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們謀善村的老祖宗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當年......這個當年，老漢我也不知道是多少年，故事是這麼一輩一輩地往下傳的，幾百年？一千年？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正那時候四面都是大山，無路可走，羽獸都飛不進來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老祖宗一個人，一把鋤頭，墾出了一塊地，挖開了一座山，然後慢慢有了這個村子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘一路走來應該看見了，方圓幾十里全是荒鹼地，窮山溝裡硬是長出來這麼一小片能擋天災、能活青苗的水土來，養著我們百來口人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一把鋤頭，就能從老天爺的手裡搶一條活路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"廟的名字叫“移山廟”，一是感謝老祖宗的恩德，二是讓我們這些後人，別忘了他的精神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這間廟保佑了謀善村千百年的安寧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"道理大家都懂，幾間土木做的房子左右不了天時，影響不了收成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但謀善村的人，祖祖輩輩都是這麼過來的，心裡有個念想，圖個心安......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹，您要罵我，就罵吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼一直盯著我看，我心裡發毛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......長高了，但沒長太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾年在外面，沒好好吃飯吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您偏要提這個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"活著就好，活著就好......爹就是擔心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們怎麼回來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走路，沿著馳道走。偶爾遇到商隊，他們的馱獸啊貨車啊，也能捎我們一程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路上，花了幾天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差不多個把月吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你跑了這麼遠啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您這幾年......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有口飯吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾年，不知道怎麼的，年成是越來越差，先是鬧了蟲災，顆粒無收，接著又是大旱，天不落雨，挖井也挖不出水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到了今年，春分，正是播種的時節，偏偏又逢著一場又一場的暴雨......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道是這片大地都這樣，還是老天爺單單不放過這一小塊地方......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者移山廟裡的先祖已經不願意保佑這村子了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是因為我炸了那間破廟。爹，您是想說這個吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹不是那個意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒本事的人才會這麼想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“種地憑的是手頭的工具和伺候水土的本事。”這個話還是以前您說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"廟裡的塑像又不會動，它難道還能起身幫我們割兩壟麥子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是這麼個道理......有什麼話不能好好講，再怎麼樣，我們有錯在先......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹，村裡人就是覺得你怕事，才敢欺負你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說什麼大山在一點點吃掉田地，土石流遲早會淹掉移山廟。遷廟就遷廟，那怎麼不挑周六的那塊背坡地，那塊地大，還不產糧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們就是欺負我們是外姓人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，不說這個了，不說這個了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_mini01_villagevacancy"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此，難怪村民看見方小石後反應那麼大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒也不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們都以為這孩子已經......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時他炸了廟，逃進了荒野......帶著傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，沒有找？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我連夜組織了人手，連著幾天，把方圓幾十里地找了個遍，一無所獲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說江南都是柳暗花明，一村又一村。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們這山裡，一眼望去，平常一片灰黃，入冬了就是茫茫的一片白，有人煙的地方，都像捉迷藏似的藏著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不少地方還有野獸占著道，路不好走，有時候還能碰上逃竄過來的流寇......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼小的孩子，又帶著那麼重的傷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他如今活蹦亂竄的，看來這小子命硬得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事、沒事就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"族長，我有一句話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仇姑娘請講，請講。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和方小石只是萍水相逢，送了他這一路。按道理，你們村子的事我不該過問什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我既然作主把他帶了回來，就得對他負責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......應該的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我雖然不敢自詡善於識人，但跟這孩子相處了一陣子，多少還是能看出一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他有些頑劣任性，可畢竟不算什麼壞人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望您不要太為難他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，還以為姑娘要說什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘大可放心，我們謀善村窮是窮了些，但基本的事理還是拎得清的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記仇......真要追究起來，到底該記誰的仇呢？記這片大山的仇，記老天爺的仇，還是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"記一個十來歲孩子的仇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘剛剛也說了，世道艱難。遷廟，只是為了讓村裡人的日子好過些，求個心安。老漢後來一想，當時大伙的做法也欠考慮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，是老漢對不起獵戶一家在先......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"族長是個明事理的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您不需要對我解釋什麼。方小石畢竟做了錯事，這三年，想必也為此吃了不少苦頭，要是還沒長記性，該管教的還是要管教。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"犯了錯，吃了苦，記了打，長了見識，才能活得不那麼辛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仇姑娘是個通透的人啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"談不上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我向您討了個說法，也算安心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"廟是我炸的，過了三年，我方小石回來了，他們要是還過不去，儘管來找我就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放到今天，我還是要去炸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炸吧，炸吧，你去炸吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三年前你就有天大的本事，三年後想必你的本事比天還大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你回來幹什麼呢？就是為了再炸一次，再跑一次？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹，我不說了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹，這塊木頭，您搬回來幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......做棺材。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹的身體一天不如一天，早幾年存下的那點棺材本，都拿出來給村裡重修移山廟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是死是活都不知道，我、我不得給自己造個能躺的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您別說氣話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹當年找了你整整一個月......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我受了傷，撐到馳道邊就暈倒了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你倒是聰明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一隊收山貨的商隊發現了我，把我扔在了專門馱草料的馱獸背上。醒來的時候，我就已經在移動城市裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好遇見的是好心人，不是野獸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那傷好了之後呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我想混出個人樣了再回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹，你不問我在移動城市裡做什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要真是做成了什麼了不得的事業，至於讓一個劍客把你送回家嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前就說過，你在謀善村這個小地方都待不下去，到了鎮子上、移動城市裡，只怕吃的苦頭更多，能撿回來一條命就算造化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹沒去過移動城市，爹不懂。以後你想說的時候，說給爹聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次回來，還鬧嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別人不欺負我們，我就不鬧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是這麼倔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你跑走的那幾天，族長動員了全村的人，幫著我一起找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一個人住在這裡，村裡人也沒有為難我，那塊“三畝三”，我不是也一直種到現在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那只能算他們還有最起碼的良心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能不能，答應爹一件事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好留下來......別折騰了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽您的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就要走嗎？去江南？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我自然有我的去處。送你回來這一趟，已經耽誤了我不少行程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也不急在這一會，天都快黑了。你乾脆休息幾天再走，順便教我武功！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一路上還沒被管教夠嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹，我們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘，謝謝你送這孩子回來，家裡也沒什麼可以......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"客氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然姑娘急著趕路，我也就不留姑娘了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"方小石，我們相逢一場，我還是有幾句話要留給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"江湖險惡，該長的見識不該長的見識你都長了，回了家，還是要安分一些，不要再耍任性了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，不管在哪，我都能混出個人樣。總有一天，你在江南也會聽見我大俠方小石的大名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別讓我聽見你為非作歹就夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再闖下什麼禍，你不一定還能遇見我這麼好說話的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，好說話......？啊，走吧走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，能不能跟我說一句那種大俠經常說的台詞。就是小說裡經常寫的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“江湖再見。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"江湖再見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g02_yanalley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仇姑娘，我送你吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不麻煩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"村裡的路好久沒修整過了，坑坑窪窪的，我送姑娘到村口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"仇白走得很快，老人緊趕幾步跟著，兩個人都沒有再說話。\n天色漸漸暗了起來，說來也怪，行走江湖的人，總是趁著夜色趕路。\n村口那座新起的墳塋，矮矮地伏著，在暮色裡不太起眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_mini02_wanedtemple"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"周四，大家都到齊了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圍觀的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"族長，我再數數......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圍觀的村民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大遠今天下地的時候，腿擦到犁受傷了，來不了，其他人都到齊了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹，全村人都來了，這場面是不是太隆重了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們又不姓周，以前在廟裡開全族大會的時候，也沒我們什麼事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟今天的事，和我們有關係......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"隔了三年，方小石重新站在了這間廟裡。這回沒有帶著土炸藥，身旁是已經衰老了許多的老爹。\n當年被他炸塌的牆壁已經重新砌好，正當中挖山人的塑像也已修復，補塑的活做得並不精細，看著有些滑稽，方小石不小心笑出了聲。\n地磚碎了好幾塊，蟲子在高處的殘梁上結網，層層疊疊，和老木頭一個顏色。\n可能是天色太暗，看得不仔細，他一時間說不上來，這間廟是從無可挽回的舊變新了一些，還是翻新後又逐漸變得破敗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才，小石已經給大伙兒道了歉，他當年還小，獵戶這三年也在盡心盡力地幫著重建移山廟，這一篇就算是翻過去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圍觀的村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"族長啊，趕緊說正事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"獵戶，你來我們謀善村多少年頭了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"獵戶","speakerId":"avg_npc_822_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今年過到頭，就二十一年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們家是村子裡唯一的外姓，但娶了我們的女娃，這麼多年過下來，早就已經是一家人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前磕磕絆絆，誤會矛盾，都是過去的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從今天起，宗族正式接納你們一家，先祖會同樣庇佑你們父子的平安和豐足。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果願意的話，小石可以改姓周。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這又是哪一齣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要不要，我很喜歡自己的名字，好端端的改什麼姓啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"方小石","speakerId":"avg_npc_820_1","isRemote":false,"text":"族長，你們到底想說什麼，直說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總之......既然我們是一家人，就要共同渡過難關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天把全村人召集到這裡，主要是為了宣佈一件事情。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老族長","speakerId":"avg_npc_821_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了村子，小石......你能不能，當一回死人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
